BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Sonoma-Marin Brat Pack
UID:event_314371751@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260531T043204Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260718T203000
SUMMARY:Cracker/Camper Van Beethoven concert
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma-Marin Brat Pack\nLet's meet at Hopmonk Novato for food/
 drinks and a fun outdoor summer concert. The main band is Cracker and they
  will also be playing Camper Van Beethoven songs. David Lowery and Johnny 
 Hickman are in both bands so it makes it easier to do that. CVB broke up i
 n 2025\, but they still have several of the musicians on this tour.\n\nI h
 ave seen Cracker/Camper play at Hopmonk several times in the past and they
  are always fun.\n\nWe can get in line at 3:30pm to get the best seating o
 ptions since it's first come/first serve. Doors open at 4pm. My goal is to
  get some seats at the long shared picnic tables in the shade. We'll have 
 time to socialize and eat/drink before the show starts at 6pm. Lots of fre
 e parking is available.\n\nPlease make sure to get your tickets before you
  RSVP at: [Cracker/Camper tix](https://wl.eventim.us/event/cracker-or-cook
 out-concert-series/681938?afflky=HopMonkNovato). Double check that you are
  buying tickets for Saturday\, July 18th\, not Sunday since they have 2 sh
 ows. As of April 19th\, there are still tickets available\, but they norma
 lly sell out. The tickets are $55.40 including the ticket fee.\n\nHope to 
 see you there! Send me a message if you have any questions.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-marin-brat-pack/events/3143717
 51/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260419T224634Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260419T224634Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
